{"seq":1,"slug":"training-stability-tricks","title":"训练稳定性技巧","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/practice/training-stability-tricks","wordCount":1674,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"训练稳定性技巧\">训练稳定性技巧</h1><p>把一个状态空间模型训出好结果，比训一个同规模 Transformer 要小心得多。原因藏在它的本质里——SSM 是一个递归系统，状态在时间上反复经过同一个转移矩阵。这种结构天生就在数值的悬崖边上：转移矩阵的特征值稍微越界，长序列上状态要么指数爆炸、要么衰减到零，梯度跟着发散或消失。这一篇集中讲 SSM 特有的、和通用深度学习训练正交的那些稳定性技巧——参数化、初始化、归一化协调。通用的优化器、学习率调度、混合精度等内容属于 <a href=\"../../deep-learning/training-at-scale/optimization-algorithms\">深度学习 · 大规模训练</a>，这里只讲 SSM 独有的部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-递归系统的特征值悬崖\">核心概念：递归系统的特征值悬崖</h2><p>回到离散递归 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_k=\\bar{A}h_{k-1}+\\bar{B}u_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0284em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9701em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。把它沿时间展开，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 里含有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的高次幂 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{A}^{k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。线性代数告诉我们，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{A}^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的行为由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msup><mtext> 指数爆炸</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msup><mtext> 指数衰减到零</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>λ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mtext>记忆持久</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\lambda| &gt; 1 \\Rightarrow \\bar{A}^k \\text{ 指数爆炸};\\quad |\\lambda| &lt; 1 \\Rightarrow \\bar{A}^k \\text{ 指数衰减到零};\\quad |\\lambda| \\approx 1 \\Rightarrow \\text{记忆持久}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">指数爆炸</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">指数衰减到零</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">记忆持久</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>序列越长，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，这个分化越极端。训练时若 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的特征值飘到单位圆外，几千步的序列就足以让激活值溢出成 NaN。所以 SSM 的稳定性，归根结底是「把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的特征值牢牢钉在单位圆内、且尽量贴近边界以保住长程记忆」这一件事。下面所有技巧都是为它服务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参数化-a-用对数和负实部\">参数化 A：用对数和负实部</h2><p>直接学一个自由的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 矩阵很危险——优化器随时可能把它推到不稳定区。SSM 的标准做法是<strong>约束式参数化</strong>，让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 在构造上就不可能失稳。</p>\n<p>连续 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的特征值实部决定衰减：实部为负则离散后特征值模长小于 1（稳定）。为强制这一点，实现里通常学习的不是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 本身，而是它的对数，再用指数恢复并取负：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = -\\exp(A_{\\log})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">l</span><span class=\"mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\exp</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span></span></span></span></span> 保证为正，前面的负号保证连续特征值实部恒为负，于是离散后必稳定。对复数对角 SSM（如 S4D、Mamba 的对角底座），则分别参数化实部（强制为负）与虚部（自由，编码振荡频率）。这套「学对数、强制负实部」是 SSM 稳定训练的第一道也是最重要的一道闸。</p>\n<h2 id=\"初始化-与-a-贴边但不越界\">初始化 Δ 与 A：贴边但不越界</h2><p><a href=\"../architectures/s4-structured-ssm\">S4 结构化状态空间</a> 强调过 HiPPO 初始化对长程能力的决定性作用，这里补上工程细节：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的对角元素初始化为 HiPPO 特征值，让状态一开始就具备多项式记忆。</p>\n<p>步长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 的初始化同样讲究。<a href=\"../foundations/discretization-recurrence\">离散化与递归形式</a> 说过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 控制时间分辨率，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{A}=\\exp(\\Delta A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 和特征值耦合在一起——<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 太大，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\exp(\\Delta A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 偏离 1 太远，记忆跨度太短且易不稳；太小则系统几乎不更新状态，学不到东西。标准做法是把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 用 softplus 参数化保证为正，并初始化在一个适中区间（常见取对数均匀分布于约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.001</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.001</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span>），让不同通道覆盖从短到长的多种时间尺度。这种「多尺度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 初始化」让模型自带处理不同时间跨度的能力。</p>\n<p>下表汇总 SSM 特有的参数化与初始化约束。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>参数化/初始化手段</th>\n<th>目的</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 实部</td>\n<td>特征值越出单位圆</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=-\\exp(A_{\\log})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">l</span><span class=\"mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>恒稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 虚部</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>自由，HiPPO 初始化</td>\n<td>编码振荡/长程记忆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>步长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>太大失稳/太小不学</td>\n<td>softplus + 对数均匀初始化</td>\n<td>多时间尺度覆盖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>B</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{B},C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0145em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>量级失配</td>\n<td>标准线性层初始化</td>\n<td>输入输出尺度匹配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"归一化与残差-让深堆叠不崩\">归一化与残差：让深堆叠不崩</h2><p>单层稳定不代表深堆叠稳定。和 Transformer 一样，SSM 深网也依赖归一化和残差连接来稳住信号流。实践中 SSM 块普遍采用前置归一化（pre-norm，RMSNorm 常见）配残差——把归一化放在子层之前，让残差路径保持「干净」的恒等映射，深堆叠时梯度才不衰减。Mamba 块本身的门控支路（见 <a href=\"../architectures/mamba-selective-ssm\">Mamba 选择性状态空间</a>）也起到稳定输出量级的作用。</p>\n<p>混合架构（见 <a href=\"../applications/hybrid-attention-ssm\">注意力混合架构</a>）多了一层协调难题：Mamba 层和注意力层的激活统计、对学习率的敏感度不完全一样。实践经验是统一用 pre-norm 框架、保持两类层共享同一套残差骨架，并在调学习率时留意注意力层通常比 Mamba 层更需要 warmup。NVIDIA 在 Nemotron-H 上还报告了用 FP8 训练大部分层、但把首尾若干层保留在 BF16 的做法——首尾层数值更敏感，低精度容易放大误差，这是低精度训练 SSM 的一条实用经验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"长序列训练的额外护栏\">长序列训练的额外护栏</h2><p>序列拉长会放大一切不稳定。几条额外护栏值得记住：其一，<strong>梯度裁剪</strong>在 SSM 上比在 Transformer 上更常用也更关键，因为递归更容易制造梯度尖峰；其二，<a href=\"../architectures/hardware-aware-parallel-scan\">硬件感知并行扫描</a> 里的反向重计算虽省内存，但要保证重算的前向与正向数值一致，否则梯度会悄悄偏差；其三，训练后期逐步增大序列长度（长度课程）有助于先在短序列上把动态学稳，再扩展到长程，呼应 <a href=\"../applications/long-sequence-modeling\">长序列建模</a> 里长度外推的讨论。</p>\n<p>下图把 SSM 训练稳定性的因果链收束起来。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[递归系统反复过 Ā] --&gt; B[病根: 特征值越界则爆炸/消失]&#10;    B --&gt; C[参数化 A=-exp A_log 强制负实部]&#10;    B --&gt; D[Δ softplus + 多尺度对数初始化]&#10;    C --&gt; E[单层恒稳定]&#10;    D --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[pre-norm + 残差稳深堆叠]&#10;    F --&gt; G{混合架构}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[协调两类层归一化与 warmup]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| I[纯 SSM]&#10;    E --&gt; J[梯度裁剪 + 重计算一致 + 长度课程]&#10;    H --&gt; K[稳定训练]&#10;    I --&gt; K&#10;    J --&gt; K\">flowchart TD\n    A[递归系统反复过 Ā] --&gt; B[病根: 特征值越界则爆炸/消失]\n    B --&gt; C[参数化 A=-exp A_log 强制负实部]\n    B --&gt; D[Δ softplus + 多尺度对数初始化]\n    C --&gt; E[单层恒稳定]\n    D --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[pre-norm + 残差稳深堆叠]\n    F --&gt; G{混合架构}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[协调两类层归一化与 warmup]\n    G --&gt;|否| I[纯 SSM]\n    E --&gt; J[梯度裁剪 + 重计算一致 + 长度课程]\n    H --&gt; K[稳定训练]\n    I --&gt; K\n    J --&gt; K</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>SSM 训练的核心风险是递归中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>A</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{A}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1111em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的高次幂：特征值越出单位圆则状态指数爆炸/消失，长序列尤甚。</li>\n<li>标准对策是约束式参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=-\\exp(A_{\\log})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">l</span><span class=\"mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 强制连续特征值负实部，使离散后恒稳定；复数对角 SSM 分别约束实部与虚部。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 用 softplus 保正并按对数均匀多尺度初始化，配合 HiPPO 初始化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，让模型自带长程记忆与多时间尺度能力。</li>\n<li>深堆叠靠 pre-norm + 残差稳信号；混合架构需协调 Mamba 与注意力层的归一化与 warmup，低精度训练宜保留首尾层为高精度。</li>\n<li>长序列额外护栏：更激进的梯度裁剪、保证重计算数值一致、训练后期用长度课程。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>稳定性约束服务的卷积核计算与 HiPPO 初始化：<a href=\"../architectures/s4-structured-ssm\">S4 结构化状态空间</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span></span></span></span></span> 与特征值耦合的来源：<a href=\"../foundations/discretization-recurrence\">离散化与递归形式</a>。</li>\n<li>混合架构的层协调背景：<a href=\"../applications/hybrid-attention-ssm\">注意力混合架构</a>。</li>\n<li>通用优化器、学习率、混合精度：<a href=\"../../deep-learning/training-at-scale/optimization-algorithms\">深度学习 · 大规模训练</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"训练稳定性技巧","id":"训练稳定性技巧"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：递归系统的特征值悬崖","id":"核心概念-递归系统的特征值悬崖"},{"level":2,"text":"参数化 A：用对数和负实部","id":"参数化-a-用对数和负实部"},{"level":2,"text":"初始化 Δ 与 A：贴边但不越界","id":"初始化-与-a-贴边但不越界"},{"level":2,"text":"归一化与残差：让深堆叠不崩","id":"归一化与残差-让深堆叠不崩"},{"level":2,"text":"长序列训练的额外护栏","id":"长序列训练的额外护栏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"跨模态应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/applications/ssm-beyond-language"},"next":{"title":"与 Transformer 的对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/state-space-models-mamba/practice/benchmarks-vs-transformers"}}